 "defect": {
  "defect_type": "missing",
  "message": "The plain laminated elastomeric bearings are described only by their internal rubber layers (\"four internal rubber layers 8 mm thick\"). The bearing plan dimensions a and b (mm) are not given. The KG instance constraint C-02 requires complete bearing parameters for laminated elastomeric bearings (plane dimensions AND rubber layers: \"板式橡胶支座需平面尺寸与橡胶层\"), and the shape factor S = a*b/(2*t1*(a+b)) per JTG 3362-2018 8.7 needs a and b to compute the bearing stiffness. No default plan size is provided by the KG, so the bearing stiffness (S, Kv, Kh) and thus the boundary conditions cannot be determined without these dimensions."
 },
